 "Back": "Morago",
 "Pick a style and make it yours. Cammy, your assistant, will wear it too.": "Kgetha mokgwa gomme o o dire wa gago. Cammy, mothuši wa gago, le yena o tla o apara.",
 "Sets your starting avatar. You can design your own look later.": "E bea avatar ya gago ya mathomo. O ka hlama ponagalo ya gago morago.",
 "We'll celebrate your birthday with you. Only the day and month are ever shown to others.": "Re tla keteka letšatši la gago la matswalo le wena. Ke letšatši le kgwedi fela tšeo di bontšhwago ba bangwe.",
