 "Easy-read mode": "Mokgwa wa go bala go bonolo",
 "Simpler pages with less on screen and a short guide at the top": "Matlakala a bonolo a nago le dilo tše mmalwa sekirining le tlhahlo ye kopana godimo",
 "Listening & speaking": "Go theeletša le go bolela",
 "Read Cammy's replies aloud": "Bala dikarabo tša Cammy ka go kwagala",
 "Cammy speaks each answer automatically": "Cammy o bolela karabo ye nngwe le ye nngwe ka boyona",
 "Reading speed": "Lebelo la go bala",
