 "Fast": "Ka lebelo",
 "Faster": "Ka lebelo kudu",
 "Read aloud is not supported in this browser.": "Go bala ka go kwagala ga go thekgwe ke sefetleki se.",
 "Voice input: press the microphone in any message box to dictate.": "Go tsenya ka lentšu: tobetša maekrofouno lepokising le lengwe le le lengwe la molaetša go bolela.",
 "Voice input needs Chrome or Edge.": "Go tsenya ka lentšu go nyaka Chrome goba Edge.",
 "Keyboard & support": "Khiboto le thekgo",
 "Close": "Tswalela",
 "Shortcuts work anywhere except while you are typing in a field.": "Ditsela tše kopana di šoma gohle ntle le ge o thaepa lefelong.",
 "Show this help": "Bontšha thušo ye",
